Package: ImmuneHierDeconv
Type: Package
Title: ImmuCellAI 2.0 Variational Bayesian Immune Deconvolution
Version: 0.1.7
Authors@R: c(person(given = "Jingmin", family = "Yang", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "yangjingmin89@gmail.com"))
Description: Implements the ImmuCellAI 2.0 reference-based deterministic
    variational Bayesian framework for estimating 53 immune-cell fractions
    from bulk RNA-seq expression matrices. The manuscript workflow uses a
    5,510-gene marker panel and targeted hierarchical refinement of CD4 and
    CD8 T-cell states while retaining other immune states as independent
    branches. Flat and broader hierarchy modes and an optional residual state
    are provided for sensitivity analyses.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: stats, utils, parallel
Suggests: testthat
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
